    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my doctor put me on quetiapine for my anxiety and to help me sleep but i keep waking up at like 3am and feeling super restless. i have some old zolpidem (ambien) from a few years ago still in my cabinet... is it safe if i take a small dose of that if the quetiapine doesnt work? i just really need a full night of sleep",
