    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, i should call them but it's the weekend and they're closed until monday. i just cant handle another night of this. is there really a big risk? i mean the ambien is just for sleep and the quetiapine is for anxiety, they aren't even the same kind of drug right? i just want to know if a tiny amount would even matter.",
