      "content": "Even a \"tiny bit\" of an old, unverified dose of zolpidem can interact with quetiapine in ways you cannot predict. I strongly advise against self-medicating with old prescriptions because potency can change, and combining sedatives increases the risk of next-day grogginess or impairment. For immediate relief, try some non-pharmacological techniques like deep breathing or a warm bath tonight instead of risking a drug interaction.",
